                <pb facs="0442" n="430" xml:id="pg430"/>

                <head>Chapter II: November 19 to December 31, 1945</head>
                <p>Armed uprisings against the Iranian Central Government in Soviet-occupied
                    Azerbaijan; continued Soviet Army interference with the movement of Iranian
                    security forces in northern Iran; United States note of November 23 to the
                    Soviet Union proposing withdrawal of all foreign troops from Iran by January 1,
                    1946; Soviet rejection of the note; attempts by American Embassy officers to
                    visit Azerbaijan; discussions on Iran during the Moscow meeting of Foreign
                    Ministers; evacuation of American troops from Iran on December 30</p>






































































































































